@startuml
title Estados de SearchSession
[*] --> Created : create()
Created --> Active : persistir + agregar/cachear
Active --> Expired : now >= expiresAt
Expired --> Destroyed : cleanup worker / DELETE físico
Active --> Destroyed : eliminación administrativa
Created --> Destroyed : eliminación administrativa o limpieza
Destroyed --> [*]

note right of Active
  La sesión y el snapshot existen
  únicamente durante su TTL.
end note
note right of Destroyed
  ON DELETE CASCADE elimina search_cache.
end note
@enduml

